      en: ["The airport was formerly known as Mogadishu International Airport.", "It was renamed in 2007 to honor the nation's first president.", "The airport's runway has a total length of 3,270 meters.", "The official IATA code for the airport is MGQ.", "The terminal renovation was primarily carried out by the SKA company.", "The airport serves as a major base for the African Union mission."],
