      en: ["The mosque is the largest Islamic place of worship in Hargeisa.", "It features two slender minarets that are visible from across the city.", "The Jama Mosque was constructed on a historically significant site.", "Friday prayers often draw a congregation of more than 5,000 worshippers.", "The building also functions as a major center for Islamic studies.", "The architecture emphasizes symmetry and a bright, white color scheme."],
